5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we should start by ensuring our reporting is transparent. I'll look into the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am interested in our human capacity. I will examine the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I would like to see if our narratives match reality. I'll look into the profile of the exits and the write-off, and account retention through price rises.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to understand our financial flexibility. I'll check the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, and the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on the friction between funding and deployment. I'll look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
