50,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Looking at the candidates, Ledger Bridge seems the most harmonious. It's software, so it avoids the appraisal delays and audit fees I found.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Ledger Bridge doesn't require the field crews or shift supervisors that our recruiters struggle to find. It fits our capacity.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Ledger Bridge matches the profile of our successful exits—quiet back-office tooling for financial operations. It's a proven path for us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,It also avoids the equipment-heavy follow-on calls that are draining our reserves. It's the most fiscally responsible choice.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shion,,It avoids the medical security delays of Clinic Scheduler and the hardware risks of Harvest Sensor and Fabric Loop. It's the fastest route to deployment.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, I agree. The lack of physical assets means we can close our quarters without the five-figure appraisal fees.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, and since it's a lean software model, it shouldn't put the same pressure on our partner board seats as a complex operation would.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I'm curious about the others, but the data on our write-offs makes Fabric Loop's sorting facilities look very risky.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, I agree. Physical premises and hourly crews were exactly what led to our previous write-off.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Shion,,Clinic Scheduler is a non-starter for me. Three quarters of security review is a luxury we can't afford right now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I feel we have a strong consensus. Ledger Bridge is the only one that satisfies our need for reporting ease and operational speed.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am completely on board. It's the most peaceful choice for the partnership.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. It aligns with the reality of our returns rather than the ambition of the pitch.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I am satisfied. It protects our liquidity and avoids the volatility of hardware.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Shion,,"The logic is inescapable. It's the only candidate with a clear, unobstructed path.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,I vote for Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
